# Mental Model

Think of it as two separate optimizations:

### IVF = Search Fewer Vectors

```text
1,000,000 vectors
        ↓
nearest cluster
        ↓
5,000 vectors
```

Speed optimization.

---

### PQ = Store Smaller Vectors

```text
1536 floats
        ↓
compressed code
```

Memory optimization.

---

### IVF + PQ

```text
Search fewer vectors
+
Store smaller vectors
```

which is why IVF-PQ became one of the foundational techniques behind production-scale vector search and large RAG systems.
